===Origin===
*'''Singe''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Cyndaquil|104}} and {{TCG ID|Expedition|Ponyta|126}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*The '''Pop-Punk''' attack is named after {{wp|pop-punk}}, a genre of music.

